      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "ee35106",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft provides plastics that improve safety, efficiency, and durability in electrical and power generation systems. Contractors and energy manufacturers rely on our materials because they deliver long-lasting insulation, resistance to heat, and strong electrical properties.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Our plastics are used in solar arrays, wind turbines, circuit boards, and cable jacketing, offering lightweight alternatives to metal components. They resist corrosion, provide high dielectric strength, and are easy to fabricate for both high- and low-voltage applications. Whether used in renewable energy or traditional electrical systems, our plastics help reduce maintenance and extend product life, ensuring dependable performance in demanding environments.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
